DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260610T000000
UID:73ed00db6dca69254c9aaacc29a5be54@solutionsjournalism.org
DESCRIPTION:Online\nThe Advancing Democracy Peer Network is a space for so
 lutions-minded journalists covering politics\, government and elections. H
 osted by SJN\, Hearken and Trusting News\, the sessions offer guest speake
 rs\, peer problem-solving and breakout discussions for journalists reporti
 ng on these issues.Join to attend this month's gathering (or subsequent on
 es).\nThe peer network generally gathers on the first Wednesday of each mo
 nth\, but the schedule is subject to change.
LOCATION:Online
