 onnect at the IRE and NICAR annual conference. We'll offer a session on us
 ing solutions journalism in investigations with Peter Gill of Newsday\, Ge
 orge Chidi of The Guardian and Tina Rosenberg of the Solutions Journalism 
 Network.
LOCATION:National Harbor\, Maryland\, United States
URL:https://www.ire.org/training/conferences/ire-2026/
