BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:National Association of Hispanic Journalists (NAHJ) Conference 202
 6
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T000000
UID:522d39eaa8e36727cff366ea020927f3@solutionsjournalism.org
DESCRIPTION:New Orleans\, Louisiana\, United States\nLooking to grow your 
 skills and expand your network? The NAHJ National Conference offers both. 
 Join Latino News Network publisher and solutions journalism trainer Hugo B
 alta for a hands-on session on covering Latino health disparities through 
 a solutions journalism lens. You’ll learn practical reporting techniques
  to identify how communities and institutions are addressing these challen
 ges\, evaluate their effectiveness and share their insights.
LOCATION:New Orleans\, Louisiana\, United States
URL:https://nahjconference.org/
X-SOURCE:Solutions Journalism Network
